# Gives Code Monkey sessions on this repository sudo and Docker
# (lfreleng-actions/github-code-monkey-bot, docs/DESIGN.md section 4.1).
# Only this file's presence at the root of the default branch counts;
# the bot never reads its content.
#
# Why: this repository is a multi-image fixture for the Docker build
# actions. Its Makefile builds the images, one on top of another, and
# tests/scripts/test_images.sh runs them. A change to the fixture
# cannot be checked unless the session can build and run containers.
